                "text": "Donald Trump and Congressional Republicans are raising the price of health insurance premiums by more than double \u2013 an average of 136% this year.\n\nHere's how much more you could be paying for ACA coverage in each state:\n\nAlabama +$506\nAlaska +$909\nArizona +$639\nArkansas + $848\nCalifornia +$1,000\nColorado +$769\nConnecticut +$534\nDelaware +$813\nDistrict of Columbia +$1,066\nFlorida +$521\nGeorgia +$539\nHawaii +$714\nIdaho +$581\nIllinois +$727\nIndiana +$795\nIowa +$610\nKansas +$586\nKentucky +$684\nLouisiana +$637\nMaine +$886\nMaryland +$929\nMassachusetts +$405\nMichigan +$710\nMinnesota +$755\nMississippi +$602\nMissouri +$720\nMontana +$826\nNebraska +$501\nNevada +$762\nNew Hampshire +$838\nNew Jersey +$853\nNew Mexico +$390\nNew York +$877\nNorth Carolina +$626\nNorth Dakota +$688\nOhio +$698\nOklahoma +$532\nOregon +$772\nPennsylvania +$581\nRhode Island +$770\nSouth Carolina +$470\nSouth Dakota +$682\nTennessee +$464\nTexas +$459\nUtah +$478\nVermont +$476\nVirginia +$731\nWashington +$652\nWest Virginia +$410\nWisconsin +$593\nWyoming +$367",
