                "text": "Thanks to Republicans in Congress, some Americans will have to pay more than $22,000 every year to keep their health insurance coverage.\n\n$22,000.\n\nThat could be a matter of keeping health care coverage or just giving up\u2014and for some people, life and death. https://t.co/tDvKtNZ5tM",
