                "text": "We\u2019re in a health care crisis. \n\nHospitals and clinics will close from Trump\u2019s cuts.\n\n15 million people will lose their health care. \n\nNow Trump\u2019s CDC layoffs are making it even WORSE by gutting our ability to stop emerging health threats.\n\nDemocrats are fighting to stop this.",
